{
  "slug": "opsera-devsecops",
  "name": "Opsera Devsecops",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Opsera DevSecOps Agent — AI-powered architecture analysis, security scanning, compliance auditing, and SQL security for your codebase. Free trial included.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**, **1 agent**, **4 commands**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `architecture-analyze` (Risk-focused architecture analysis that unearths deep insights specific to the codebase), `compliance-audit` (Evidence-based compliance auditing for SOC2, HIPAA, PCI-DSS, and ISO 27001 frameworks), `pre-commit-scan` (Automatic security scan triggered before git commits), `security-scan` (Technical security scanning for vulnerabilities, secrets, SAST, container security, and infrastructure-as-code issues), `sql-security` (AI-powered SQL security scanning and auto-fix for Databricks and general SQL)\n- **Agents** (1): `devsecops` (Opsera DevSecOps Agent — performs architecture analysis, security scanning, compliance auditing, and SQL security analysis)\n- **Commands** (4): `architecture-analyze`, `compliance-audit`, `security-scan`, `sql-security`\n- **Hooks** (1): `PreToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `opsera`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install opsera-devsecops@claude-community` from `opsera-agents/opsera-devsecops`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
